oe at all he reveals his  calmness confidence and pride was an act  that was completely tied to favourable  circumstances he licks Jotaro shoe and  begs for his own life in the most  pathetic way possible however he still  plans on trying to trick Joe he plans to  use his stand on him he's just acting  like he accepts the feet to buy time it  is clear that he is a man who possesses  no honor at all Joe toe catches Steely  Dan stand with his own stand and starts  to crush it  he breaks Dan's arm and leg in the  process Judas says that the arm and the  leg were payment for all the things he  did to him he starts to walk away giving  Dan hope for a third time  Dan not knowing when to quit tries to  take over a nearby girl thinking that  Joe total won't risk hurting the girl he  approaches Joe total to stab him but Joe  Torre's dad calm he just says go ahead  and do it then he grabs Dan's hand and  use it to cut Dan's face he reveals that  his friend kakyoin has trapped Steely  Dan's  and he never had any intention of  letting dangle so easy then offers Joe  throw all the money deal gave him but  Joe Thoreau calls him the worst man in  the history of mankind and explains that  the debt he owes can't be bought with  money in the manga Joe tiller goes on to  punch Dan with his stand for almost four  full pages straight if you read manga  you know that this is a lot of space in  a chapter usually when there's one full  page dedicated to something it's a huge  deal but this is virtually unprecedented  it's also awesome in the anime but the  length it gets in the manga is extremely  satisfying as if that wasn't that big  enough Joe Thoreau done signs his name  and rips out a page from his notebook  saying and here is your receipt he  throws it on the ground and walks away  like a boss this is one of my favorite  moments in anime after initially being  upset and losing his cool Joe Turner  quickly accepts the reality of the  situation and remains calm and even  amused as Dan 